        "id": 3948337
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-09-02T22:10:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "No, if a multi-component type crosses a float4 boundary, we set `currentComp` to 0 and increment `currentTexel`.\n\nHowever, I realized that this needs to obey std::430 rules too, so I\u0027ve updated this and added tests.",
      "parentUuid": "bbf152cd_9b9699e8",
